&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #fe1251;&quot;&gt;About Grover&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2015, Grover enables consumers and businesses across Europe to subscribe to tech devices and comprehensive technology solutions - from individual smartphones, laptops, and wearables to full corporate device setups. The company offers access to over 1,000 unique tech items on flexible and financially convenient terms. A pioneer of the circular economy, Grover refurbishes and recirculates devices to help eliminate e-waste.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We are looking for an enthusiastic &lt;strong&gt;Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;B2B Sales&lt;/strong&gt; team at Grover, full-time and a minimum 3 days per week (Tuesday-Thursday) at our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Berlin HQ.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As an Account Executive (B2B), you will play a key role in driving Grover&#39;s new business growth by owning opportunities from the very first touchpoint to close. Reporting directly to the Team Lead B2B, you will run the complete sales motion yourself: you identify your target accounts, open the door through outbound prospecting, qualify your own meetings, and convert them into revenue, alongside working inbound leads. This is a high-impact role with true end-to-end ownership, where success is measured by revenue results, pipeline quality and commercial execution. You will work closely with cross-functional teams to deliver a strong customer buying experience and help shape how Grover scales its B2B sales motion. If you are a commercially driven seller who enjoys hunting, closing, and building, this role offers strong growth and progression opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;What you will contribute:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own the full sales cycle end to end, from prospecting and qualification through first meeting, negotiation, and close, ensuring consistent conversion into revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build, manage, and close a high-quality pipeline that you generate yourself through outbound efforts, alongside inbound leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own your top of funnel: research target accounts, run email sequences, LinkedIn outreach, and trigger-based calling, and book and qualify your own meetings. This role requires a strong hunter mindset and comfort operating in ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive new business acquisition by converting opportunities into long-term customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Expand and grow existing accounts by identifying upsell and cross-sell opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead consultative sales conversations, understanding client needs and positioning Grover&#39;s solution effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Navigate and manage complex sales cycles, including stakeholder alignment and objection handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Take ownership of deal progression, ensuring momentum and minimizing drop-offs in the funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and continuously refine your outbound approach (target lists, messaging, sequences, cadences) to improve pipeline generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Product and Operations to address onboarding friction and improve customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Provide structured market feedback to influence pricing, offering, and go-to-market strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤝 What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;2-4 years of experience in B2B sales/Account Executive positions, ideally in a fast-paced scale-up or tech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven track record of achieving or exceeding quota targets and closing new business consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong hunter mentality: you generate your own pipeline through outbound prospecting (email sequences, LinkedIn, trigger-based calling) and don&#39;t wait for leads to come to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and objection-handling skills across different stakeholder levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong consultative selling skills with the ability to understand customer needs and position value clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to manage multiple opportunities and sales cycles in a structured, disciplined way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Commercial mindset with focus on revenue, urgency, and deal progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Independent, proactive, and highly collaborative way of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with HubSpot, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, or Lusha (our current sales stack) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Fluent German (C1 minimum) and strong English skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 The Grover Way - How We Drive Success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own It:&lt;/strong&gt; We take ownership seriously and define what success looks like. We drive shared ownership and don&#39;t wait - we drive. We keep one another accountable and take responsibility when issues arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenge, Decide,&lt;/strong&gt; and Commit: We engage in proactive support, active listening, and healthy conflict to reach the best outcomes. We value diverse perspectives and, once a decision is made, we commit to it fully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower and Grow:&lt;/strong&gt; We enable, trust, and coach one another toward high performance, always thinking and acting like owners. We seek growth, apply feedback, and support the development of our peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Respect, Transparency, and Clarity: &lt;/strong&gt;We strive for clear, respectful, and open communication with no surprises. We simplify complex information so everyone knows the &quot;what, why, and how&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;❤️‍🔥 What you will love about us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A diverse global team of 75 nationalities (and counting!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Virtual or In-person Coaching Sessions with the Fürstenberg Institut&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Physical health support with Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Annual learning budget of 750€&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;4 Volunteer days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;15 remote business days per year to work abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BVG monthly discount to drive you everywhere in Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Exclusive Grover Tech discount for you &amp;amp; your loved ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Engaging, open office located in Berlin-Schöneberg with regular events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Embark on a rewarding journey with us, where your impact is felt, and together, we cultivate a more circular world. 💚&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We are looking forward to e-meeting you! 🚀&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #fe1251;&quot;&gt;About Grover&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2015, Grover enables consumers and businesses across Europe to subscribe to tech devices and comprehensive technology solutions - from individual smartphones, laptops, and wearables to full corporate device setups. The company offers access to over 1,000 unique tech items on flexible and financially convenient terms. A pioneer of the circular economy, Grover refurbishes and recirculates devices to help eliminate e-waste.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a full-time &lt;strong&gt;Director of Category Management (40h/week, hybrid, Tuesday-Thursday onsite) &lt;/strong&gt;to join our talented &lt;strong&gt;Category Management &lt;/strong&gt;team in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to our Chief Commercial Officer, you will be a key member of the Commercial Leadership Team and play a pivotal role in shaping the future of the business. The Director of Category Management will own our device category strategy end-to-end, from assortment, merchandising, and supplier relationships to margin, fulfilment, and inventory health. You will ensure Grover offers the right products, at the right price, at the right time, balancing customer desirability with commercial profitability and sustainable circularity. You will lead a talented category management team, and collaborate closely with supply chain, procurement, marketing, pricing, product, finance, and tech teams to deliver a best-in-class catalogue from sourcing to sell-through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;🎯 What you will contribute:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and own the multi-year category strategy and roadmap across device types (smartphones, laptops, wearables, and more), balancing growth, profitability, and circularity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; Vendor Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and lead commercial relationships with OEMs, distributors, and refurbishment partners; negotiate pricing, terms, and volume commitments to secure competitive advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assortment Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Own end-to-end assortment strategy, selecting, sequencing, and retiring products based on customer demand, market trends, and margin contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merchandising: &lt;/strong&gt;A sharp eye for how assortment decisions play out as merchandising on the platform, from launch sequencing to cross-sell and bundling that lift conversion and basket size.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing &amp;amp; Margin Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Set pricing strategy and promotional mechanics across categories, owning category P&amp;amp;L and driving sustainable unit economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory &amp;amp; Lifecycle Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with supply chain to optimise stock levels, minimise obsolescence, and maximise device lifecycle value and residual returns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive relentless, week-on-week execution against sales and revenue targets, tracking performance daily, diagnosing gaps in real time, and course-correcting pricing, promotions, or channel mix to keep the category on plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Procurement, Marketing, Product, and Pricing teams to align category plans with acquisition, retention, and platform priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor category KPIs (availability, sell-through, margin, NPS) to drive insight-led decision-making and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and mentor a high-performing category management team, nurturing future leaders and a culture of accountability and commercial rigour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤝 What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A degree in Business, Supply Chain, Marketing, or a related field (Master&#39;s preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience in category management, merchandising, or commercial buying within high-growth B2C industries such as e-commerce, retail, subscriptions, marketplaces, or consumer electronics/tech, including at least 10 years leading cross-functional teams covering sourcing, pricing, and assortment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in vendor negotiation, pricing strategy, merchandising and inventory management, ideally with experience across a multi-category or multi-market portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on &amp;amp; Strategic Scope:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to zoom in and out between strategic category vision and operational execution, with a track record of owning €10M+ category P&amp;amp;Ls and delivering sustainable growth and margin improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Analytical Balance:&lt;/strong&gt; A &quot;strategic operator&quot; who pairs sharp commercial negotiation with data-driven decision-making across pricing, demand, and inventory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Deeply comfortable in technology-led and data-driven environments, proficient with modern analytics, forecasting, and inventory management tools, with a collaborative approach to working with supply chain, data, and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; A natural mentor with a passion for building and leading high-performing teams, skilled at collaborating across and influencing at the executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional verbal and written communication skills in English are a must; German language skills are a significant advantage for winning in the DACH market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 The Grover Way - How We Drive Success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own It:&lt;/strong&gt; We take ownership seriously and define what success looks like. We drive shared ownership and don&#39;t wait - we drive. We keep one another accountable and take responsibility when issues arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenge, Decide, and Commit: &lt;/strong&gt;We engage in proactive support, active listening, and healthy conflict to reach the best outcomes. We value diverse perspectives and, once a decision is made, we commit to it fully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower and Grow: &lt;/strong&gt;We enable, trust, and coach one another toward high performance, always thinking and acting like owners. We seek growth, apply feedback, and support the development of our peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Respect, Transparency, and Clarity&lt;/strong&gt;: We strive for clear, respectful, and open communication with no surprises. We simplify complex information so everyone knows the &quot;what, why, and how&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;❤️‍🔥 What you will love about us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse global team of 75 nationalities (and counting!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual or In-person Coaching Sessions with the Fürstenberg Institut&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physical health support with Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual learning budget of 750€&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15 remote business days per year to work abroad&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 Volunteer days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exclusive Grover Tech discount&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BVG monthly discount to drive you everywhere in Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging, open office located in Berlin-Schöneberg with regular events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Embark on a rewarding journey with the Grover Rocketship, where your impact is felt, and together, we cultivate a more circular world. 💚&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking forward to e-meeting you! 🚀&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #fe1251;&quot;&gt;About Grover&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2015, Grover enables consumers and businesses across Europe to subscribe to tech devices and comprehensive technology solutions - from individual smartphones, laptops, and wearables to full corporate device setups. The company offers access to over 1,000 unique tech items on flexible and financially convenient terms. A pioneer of the circular economy, Grover refurbishes and recirculates devices to help eliminate e-waste.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To continue this incredible adventure, we are currently looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Sr. Product Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to join our talented &lt;strong&gt;Product Team &lt;/strong&gt;at our &lt;strong&gt;Berlin HQ (3 days per week - Tuesday-Thursday).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Product Director, you will act as a key strategic partner for Product, Engineering, and Design, with a specialized focus on optimizing our Acquisition and Retention domains. You will be responsible for enabling data-inspired product decisions that lift Grover’s user experience to a new level and have a considerable business impact. You foster an environment where data is leveraged effectively to shape product strategy, identify opportunities, and measure success. You do so by ensuring each team has access to the right data, delivering high-quality analyses that uncover actionable insights, and championing best practices in experimentation and data-inspired decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯&amp;nbsp; What you will contribute:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary data partner for the Acquisition and Retention domains, uncovering insights that drive growth and long-term customer loyalty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the end-to-end A/B testing lifecycle using our experimentation platform, Eppo, ensuring statistical reliability and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Support and consult on company-wide decision-making through deep-dive product insights and behavioral analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to defining and maintaining Grover&#39;s PIs/KPIs, ensuring they are socialized and understood by key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive new high-impact use cases by collaborating with Data Platform, Engineering, and Product teams to align technical solutions with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤝 What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytic Power:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong background in Product Analytics, ideally in fast-paced scale-up eCommerce and/or digital subscription environments, with a proven track record of delivering impactful insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Versatility:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability and excitement to work across different domains; prior experience supporting Acquisition and Retention is considered a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; High proficiency in SQL and experience with data visualization tools like Tableau, Looker, or Power BI. Familiarity with Segment is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience designing and running A/B tests (experience with Eppo is a significant advantage) and measuring the impact of new features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; An &quot;AI-first&quot; mindset with an openness to using tools like Claude to fast-track reporting, enhance documentation, and optimize analytical processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong project management skills - you can take a complex question from a vague idea to a structured, delivered insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English, with the ability to translate complex data into actionable recommendations for both technical and commercial stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 The Grover Way - How We Drive Success:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own It:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We take ownership seriously and define what success looks like. We drive shared ownership and don&#39;t wait - we drive. We keep one another accountable and take responsibility when issues arise.&lt;/li&gt;
